# A Preacher of Doom (CabalBuffer) beside a character of Dawn, which leads the Seven Signs: the
# priest starts preaching as it appears, a minute later and then every minute, a line drawn from
# its four (onCreated, onTimer). Seeing the character it draws 100 then 10000 and leaves him
# alone: it curses only the losing cabal (onSeeCreature). The curse of a Dusk character is in
# cabal_buffer_test.go: whether it lands is the world's roll, which a scenario cannot pin.
# Expectations are derived from the reference source (CabalBuffer.java).
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/cabal_buffer_preacher.golden
character Seeker 20
cabal dawn gnosis
festival 100 0
random 3 50 0 0
script script.feature.CabalBuffer
npc preacher 31093 Folk 100 0 0

advance 59s
advance 1s
  S NpcSay obj=preacher type=0 npc=1031093 text="The end of time has come! The prophecy of destruction has been fulfilled!"
tick x4
advance 1m
  S NpcSay obj=preacher type=0 npc=1031093 text="This world will soon be annihilated!"
